# Library status door

File: audit/library_status.oot
One tree: ooda/std. oodac/std is a symlink. prove/ is not a library.
Proof is emit-c + gcc + run. A folder on disk is not a cert.

files 4476  GREEN 1308  BLOCKED 3108  RESIDUAL 60  UNCHECKED 0
emit OK 4055 ERR 198 TIMEOUT 223 SEGV 0

GREEN is only a named fixtures/prove_prod_*.oo lock that emit-c + gcc + run asserted a real value.
BLOCKED quotes fail and a need: oodac line. RESIDUAL is hard-crypto leftover.

Top BLOCKED oodac needs:
  import+call gcc (dot vs arrow, Result cells, decls)
  emit-c finish under 30s
  pub fn with simple args or struct-lit drivers
  emit-c heap/abort and slist OOB
  c_emit unexpected SEMI/RBRACE
  Result[List[T]] and nested Result/Option

